# Qutrit Cube Rotation and Transformation Example

RESET

# Initialize cube with pattern
SET 0 0 0 1
SET 1 1 1 1
SET 2 2 2 1
SET 0 1 2 2
SET 2 1 0 2

PRINT Initial cube state set

# Perform rotations
ROTATE X
ROTATE Y
ROTATE Z

PRINT Cube transformations complete

# Execute ternary logic cascade
LOGIC AND 1 1
LOGIC OR 0 1
LOGIC XOR 1 0

PRINT Ternary logic operations finished
STATUS
